<% content_for :title, "About" %>

<article class="prose">
  <h1>About Me</h1>
  <p>I am a seasoned Senior Software Engineer with over 15 years of experience designing, building, and optimizing web applications, specializing in Ruby on Rails, React, and scalable cloud-based architectures. My career spans engineering, quality assurance, and leadership roles, giving me a unique perspective on delivering robust, high-quality software.</p>
  <p>I’ve led engineering teams through major framework upgrades, performance optimization initiatives, and security enhancements, while mentoring developers and fostering best practices in code quality and architecture.</p>
  <p>My background includes building healthcare, B2B, and consumer platforms with millions of users, scaling APIs and services, and deploying applications across modern cloud environments with PostgreSQL, Kubernetes, and CI/CD pipelines.</p>
  <p>I’m passionate about solving complex technical problems, mentoring the next generation of engineers, and delivering secure, performant, and maintainable applications that make a measurable impact.</p>
  <p>
    Find me on <a href="https://github.com/rhuberdeau">GitHub</a><% if (email = Rails.configuration.x.contact_email).present? %>
    or email <%= mail_to email %><% end %>.
  </p>
</article>
